+## Version 8.5.1
+
+Unreleased
+
+- Fix `default_map` being ignored for subcommands. A subcommand context now
+  receives the entry of the parent's `default_map` matching its name, instead
+  of the parent's whole map.
+
 ## Version 8.5.0
 
 Released 2026-08-24
